### 0. Kiểm tra API Gateway
GET http://localhost:4000/

### 1. [User Service] Đăng ký tài khoản mới
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "phongluong",
  "email": "phongluong@example.com",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. [User Service] Đăng nhập
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "phongluong@example.com",
  "password": "Password123@"
}

### 3. [User Service] Lấy danh sách Users
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users

### 4. [Room Service] Tạo phòng họp mới
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Virtual Office Main Hall",
  "description": "Phong hop tong quan 3D",
  "maxCapacity": 20
}

### 5. [Room Service] Lấy danh sách phòng họp
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms

### 6. [Chat Service] Lấy lịch sử chat của phòng (thay ROOM_ID bằng ID thật)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/chats/history/room_test_123

### 7. [Agent Service] Tạo Tool mới
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/tools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "calculator_tool",
  "name": "Calculator",
  "description": "Cong cu tinh toan so hoc co ban"
}

### 8. [Agent Service] Lấy danh sách Tools
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/tools

### 9. [Agent Service] Tạo Prompt mới
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/prompts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "assistant_prompt",
  "title": "Tro ly ao",
  "content": "Ban la mot tro ly AI trong khong gian 3D chuyen nghiep."
}

### 10. [Agent Service] Lấy danh sách Prompts
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/prompts

### 11. [Agent Service] Tạo Agent mới
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "agent_alpha",
  "name": "Agent Alpha 3D",
  "color": "#3182ce",
  "status": "idle",
  "speech": "Xin chao! Toi la Agent Alpha.",
  "pos_x": 0.0,
  "pos_y": 1.0,
  "pos_z": 0.0,
  "prompt_id": "assistant_prompt",
  "tool_ids": ["calculator_tool"]
}

### 12. [Agent Service] Lấy danh sách Agents
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/agents

### 13. [Room Service] Đồng bộ nhóm Agent vào Room
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms/room_test_123/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activeAgents": ["agent_manager", "agent_ml", "agent_analyst", "agent_search", "agent_summarizer"]
}

### 14. [Chat Service] Lấy danh sách thành viên & Agent Online trong phòng
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/chats/presence/room_test_123

### 15. [Chat Service] Gửi tin nhắn ra lệnh chéo cho Agent trong phòng
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/chats/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "room_test_123",
  "senderId": "user_alice",
  "senderName": "Alice",
  "senderType": "user",
  "message": "@agent_search Hãy tra cứu xu hướng AI Agent năm 2026 và @agent_ml hãy tính toán mô hình."
}

### 16. [Chat Service] Báo cáo sự hiện diện của User (Presence)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/chats/presence/room_test_123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "id": "user_bob",
    "name": "Bob Developer",
    "avatar": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/bottts/svg?seed=bob",
    "color": "#10b981"
  }
}

### 17. [Chat Service] Realtime Server-Sent Events (SSE) Stream
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/chats/stream/room_test_123
Accept: text/event-stream

### 18. [User Service] Lấy thông tin Profile cá nhân
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 19. [User Service] Cập nhật Profile cá nhân (name, bio, avatar)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phong Luong Senior AI",
  "bio": "Lead Multi-Agent Architecture & Cloud Systems",
  "avatar": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/bottts/svg?seed=PhongLuong"
}

### 20. [User Service] Lấy danh sách Agent của riêng User
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users/me/agents
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 21. [User Service] Đăng ký sở hữu Agent
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/users/me/agents/agent_ml
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 22. [Room Service] Thêm Agent vào phòng (Add Agent to Room)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms/room_test_123/agents/agent_ml
Content-Type: application/json

### 23. [Room Service] Rút bớt Agent khỏi phòng (Remove Agent from Room)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms/room_test_123/agents/agent_ml

### 24. [Room Service] Gán sở hữu Agent cho User trong phòng (User-Agent Binding)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms/room_test_123/user-agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_alice",
  "userName": "Alice Leader",
  "userColor": "#3b82f6",
  "agentId": "agent_ml",
  "agentName": "ML Expert"
}

### 25. [Room Service] Hủy gán sở hữu Agent trong phòng
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/rooms/room_test_123/user-agents/agent_ml

